下面是改成 `Responses API` 的 `requests` 伪代码：

```python
import requests


def call_llm(base_url, api_key, model, user_text, system_text=""):
    url = base_url.rstrip("/") + "/v1/responses"

    headers = {
        "Authorization": f"Bearer {api_key}",
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
    }

    body = {
        "model": model,
        "input": user_text,
    }

    if system_text:
        body["instructions"] = system_text

    response = requests.post(
        url,
        headers=headers,
        json=body,
        timeout=60,
    )

    response.raise_for_status()
    data = response.json()

    for item in data.get("output", []):
        if item.get("type") == "message":
            for part in item.get("content", []):
                if part.get("type") == "output_text":
                    return part.get("text", "")

    raise Exception("no text output found")
```

如果你想保留“消息列表”风格，也可以把 `input` 换成消息结构；`Responses` 里系统提示更推荐放在 `instructions`。

官方文档：
- [Create a model response](https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/methods/create/)
- [Migrate to the Responses API](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/migrate-to-responses)

最常用的是两种：

```json
{
  "model": "gpt-4.1",
  "input": "你好，介绍一下 agent"
}
```

更通用的是 “Items” 结构，文本块一般是 `input_text`，图片/文件也可以放进去。[官方文档](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/migrate-to-responses) 里就是这么定义的。

```json
{
  "model": "gpt-4.1",
  "input": [
    { "type": "input_text", "text": "你好" }
  ]
}
```

如果你只做文本对话，就先用字符串最省事；如果你要做多轮、多模态、工具调用，再用 Items 结构。[Create a model response](https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/methods/create/)  
[Input items](https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/subresources/input_items/methods/list/)
